---

<Layout 
  title="TPA - KB - TK Naneymi | PAUD Terpadu Islami & Generasi Qur'ani - YP2SK" 
  description="PAUD Terpadu Naneymi menghadirkan layanan TPA, KB, dan TK berbasis nilai-nilai Islam, bimbingan adab harian, hafalan doa & surat pendek, serta stimulasi motorik usia dini."
  schema={tpaKbTkNaneymiSchema}
>
  <!-- Playful Polka Dots & Soft Bubble Background -->
  <div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none overflow-hidden z-0 opacity-40">
    <div class="absolute -top-20 -left-20 w-80 h-80 rounded-full bg-amber-200/50 blur-3xl"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-1/4 -right-20 w-96 h-96 rounded-full bg-rose-200/50 blur-3xl"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-2/3 -left-24 w-96 h-96 rounded-full bg-sky-200/50 blur-3xl"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-10 right-10 w-80 h-80 rounded-full bg-emerald-200/50 blur-3xl"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative z-10 font-sans">
    <!-- Hero Section (Cheerful Early Childhood Hero with Cute Characters & Overlapping Bubbly Card) -->
    <section class="relative font-sans pb-8 sm:pb-14">
      <!-- Panoramic Banner with Playful Warm Atmosphere -->
      <div class="relative w-full h-[340px] sm:h-[400px] lg:h-[440px] overflow-hidden bg-amber-950 rounded-b-[2.5rem] sm:rounded-b-[3.5rem] shadow-md">
        <img 
          src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDovWRtuCp7DdGZnwXOeITKhBqhnaEKXESNfzh1W5uBBVVMwo152wgyFHmKKtzBvzhvf8sTrBXUOaqslDeaLL_i03eWfrR2-0fyNtfQdbSJeZq5fAPVmmTvQBLIENn3N1N7DNCmDBbTHPe2rPJ9FezGWloSBfdFRb6-adcHKvrY3VgEvHJ6eUdDkUqs21Pr_ynCs6QzFm9z2h1J0BLH3rHAgAgWBm2xvKyfQA_BXBRtOkFTrYYoXWEKkg" 
          alt="Anak-anak belajar di PAUD Terpadu Naneymi" 
          class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center opacity-85"
          loading="eager"
        />
        <!-- Cheerful Warm Gradient Overlays -->
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/80 via-slate-900/30 to-amber-500/20"></div>

        <!-- Floating Cute Character Badges inside Banner -->
        <!-- Cute Smiling Sun -->
        <div class="absolute top-6 left-6 sm:top-8 sm:left-12 flex items-center gap-2 bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-md px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full shadow-lg border border-amber-200 animate-float">
          <span class="text-xl">☀️</span>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-700">Dunia Ceria Ananda</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Cute Rainbow / Stars -->
        <div class="absolute top-6 right-6 sm:top-8 sm:right-12 hidden sm:flex items-center gap-2 bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-md px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full shadow-lg border border-rose-200 animate-float-delayed">
          <span class="text-xl">🌈</span>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-rose-600">Bermain &amp; Belajar</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Overlapping Cute Profile Header Card -->
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 -mt-20 sm:-mt-24 lg:-mt-28 relative z-20" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-duration="700">
        <!-- Floating Sticker 1: Teddy Bear on top left -->
        <div class="absolute -top-7 left-8 sm:left-12 z-30 w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-amber-100 border-2 border-amber-300 shadow-md flex items-center justify-center text-3xl animate-wiggle select-none">
          🧸
        </div>

        <!-- Floating Sticker 2: Cute Star on top right -->
        <div class="absolute -top-6 right-8 sm:right-12 z-30 w-13 h-13 rounded-2xl bg-rose-100 border-2 border-rose-300 shadow-md flex items-center justify-center text-3xl animate-float select-none">
          ⭐
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white/98 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-[2.5rem] p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-[0_15px_40px_-10px_rgba(251,146,60,0.18)] border-4 border-amber-100 text-center relative overflow-hidden">
          <!-- Playful subtle background shapes inside card -->
          <div class="absolute -top-10 -right-10 w-32 h-32 bg-amber-100/60 rounded-full blur-xl pointer-events-none"></div>
          <div class="absolute -bottom-10 -left-10 w-32 h-32 bg-pink-100/60 rounded-full blur-xl pointer-events-none"></div>

          <!-- Cute Pill Badge -->
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-100 via-rose-100 to-sky-100 text-amber-900 border-2 border-amber-200/80 font-sans mb-4 shadow-2xs">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base text-amber-600">child_care</span>
            <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold tracking-wide">TPA • KB • TK Terpadu</span>
            <span class="text-sm">🎈</span>
          </div>

          <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 leading-tight font-sans">
            PAUD Terpadu <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-rose-500 to-emerald-600">Naneymi</span>
          </h1>

          <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed font-sans font-medium italic font-serif">
            "Menyemai Fitrah Keimanan, Membentuk Karakter Qur'ani Sejak Dini Melalui Asuhan Kasih Sayang (*Tarbiyah bil-Mawaddah*)."
          </p>

          <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3.5">
            <a 
              href="#jenjang" 
              class="px-7 py-3.5 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-500 to-teal-600 hover:from-emerald-600 hover:to-teal-700 text-white font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition transform hover:-translate-y-1 active:translate-y-0 flex items-center gap-2"
            >
              <span>Pilihan Jenjang (TPA, KB, TK)</span>
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">arrow_downward</span>
            </a>
            <a 
              href="https://wa.me/6281234567890?text=Halo%20Admin%20Naneymi%2C%20saya%20ingin%20konsultasi%20pendaftaran%20PAUD%20Naneymi" 
              target="_blank" 
              rel="noopener noreferrer" 
              class="px-6 py-3.5 rounded-full bg-amber-50 hover:bg-amber-100 text-amber-900 border-2 border-amber-300 font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm shadow-xs transition transform hover:-translate-y-1 flex items-center gap-2"
            >
              <span>Konsultasi WhatsApp</span>
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm text-emerald-600">chat</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Nilai & Keunggulan Islami (Playful 3 Pillars Cards with Cute Icons & Candy Colors) -->
    <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 sm:py-16 scroll-mt-24">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 sm:gap-8">
        <!-- Card 1: Tarbiyah bil-Mawaddah (Candy Rose / Pink) -->
        <div 
          class="relative bg-gradient-to-b from-rose-50/90 to-white rounded-[2.5rem] p-8 border-3 border-rose-200 shadow-[0_10px_25px_-5px_rgba(244,63,94,0.12)] flex flex-col justify-between transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-[0_20px_35px_-5px_rgba(244,63,94,0.2)] group"
          data-aos="fade-up"
          data-aos-delay="100"
        >
          <!-- Corner Sticker Badge -->
          <div class="absolute -top-3.5 right-6 bg-rose-200 text-rose-800 text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-rose-300 flex items-center gap-1 shadow-xs">
            <span>Kasih Sayang</span> <span>💖</span>
          </div>

          <div>
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-3xl bg-rose-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-6 shadow-md shadow-rose-200 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:rotate-6 transition-transform">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl">favorite</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-2.5 font-sans group-hover:text-rose-600 transition-colors">
              Tarbiyah bil-Mawaddah
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-sans">
              Pengasuhan penuh kehangatan emosional dan kasih sayang tulus, membuat ananda merasa aman, dihargai, dan bahagia belajar setiap hari.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Bottom Playful Accents -->
          <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-rose-100 flex items-center gap-2 text-rose-600 text-xs font-bold">
            <span>🌸</span>
            <span>Suasana Ramah &amp; Hangat</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 2: Pondasi Adab & Tahfidz Dini (Soft Sky / Mint) -->
        <div 
          class="relative bg-gradient-to-b from-emerald-50/90 to-white rounded-[2.5rem] p-8 border-3 border-emerald-200 shadow-[0_10px_25px_-5px_rgba(16,185,129,0.12)] flex flex-col justify-between transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-[0_20px_35px_-5px_rgba(16,185,129,0.2)] group"
          data-aos="fade-up"
          data-aos-delay="200"
        >
          <!-- Corner Sticker Badge -->
          <div class="absolute -top-3.5 right-6 bg-emerald-200 text-emerald-800 text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-emerald-300 flex items-center gap-1 shadow-xs">
            <span>Karakter Adab</span> <span>📖</span>
          </div>

          <div>
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-3xl bg-emerald-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-6 shadow-md shadow-emerald-200 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:-rotate-6 transition-transform">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl">menu_book</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-2.5 font-sans group-hover:text-emerald-700 transition-colors">
              Pondasi Adab &amp; Tahfidz Dini
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-sans">
              Pembiasaan adab sunnah sehari-hari (makan, minum, bertutur kata), hafalan doa harian mustajab, serta tahfidz surat-surat pendek Juz 'Amma.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Bottom Playful Accents -->
          <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-emerald-100 flex items-center gap-2 text-emerald-700 text-xs font-bold">
            <span>✨</span>
            <span>Doa &amp; Surat Pilihan</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 3: Stimulasi Tumbuh Kembang (Warm Butter Yellow) -->
        <div 
          class="relative bg-gradient-to-b from-amber-50/90 to-white rounded-[2.5rem] p-8 border-3 border-amber-200 shadow-[0_10px_25px_-5px_rgba(245,158,11,0.12)] flex flex-col justify-between transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-[0_20px_35px_-5px_rgba(245,158,11,0.2)] group"
          data-aos="fade-up"
          data-aos-delay="300"
        >
          <!-- Corner Sticker Badge -->
          <div class="absolute -top-3.5 right-6 bg-amber-200 text-amber-900 text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-amber-300 flex items-center gap-1 shadow-xs">
            <span>Motorik &amp; Sensorik</span> <span>🧩</span>
          </div>

          <div>
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-3xl bg-amber-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-6 shadow-md shadow-amber-200 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:rotate-6 transition-transform">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl">sentiment_very_satisfied</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-2.5 font-sans group-hover:text-amber-600 transition-colors">
              Stimulasi Tumbuh Kembang
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-sans">
              Area stimulasi motorik kasar, motorik halus, dan sensori bermain terarah didukung pemantauan gizi dan kebersihan berkala.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Bottom Playful Accents -->
          <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-amber-100 flex items-center gap-2 text-amber-700 text-xs font-bold">
            <span>🎨</span>
            <span>Bermain Sambil Belajar</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Jenjang TPA, KB, TK Naneymi (Playful Bubbly Service Cards) -->
    <section id="jenjang" class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 sm:py-16 scroll-mt-24">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center font-sans mb-12 sm:mb-16" data-aos="fade-up">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-rose-100 text-rose-700 font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest border border-rose-200 mb-3 shadow-2xs">
          <span>🧸</span>
          <span>Layanan Terpadu</span>
          <span>🎈</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-snug font-sans">
          3 Layanan di PAUD Naneymi
        </h2>
        <div class="w-20 h-1.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-400 via-rose-400 to-emerald-400 mx-auto rounded-full mt-3"></div>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-sans">
          Disediakan secara terpadu untuk mendampingi keluarga Muslim sejak bayi hingga siap masuk SD.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 sm:gap-8">
        <!-- TPA (Daycare) - Sweet Sky Blue Theme -->
        <div 
          class="relative bg-white rounded-[2.5rem] p-7 sm:p-8 border-3 border-sky-200 shadow-soft hover:shadow-xl flex flex-col justify-between transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 group"
          data-aos="fade-up"
          data-aos-delay="100"
        >
          <!-- Cute Icon Badge Top Right -->
          <div class="absolute -top-4 -right-2 w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-sky-100 border-2 border-sky-300 text-sky-600 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl shadow-sm rotate-6 group-hover:rotate-12 transition-transform">
            🍼
          </div>

          <div>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-sky-100 text-sky-700 font-bold text-xs border border-sky-200 font-sans">
              <span>🐣</span> Usia 3 Bulan - 2 Tahun
            </span>
            <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-4 mb-2.5 font-sans group-hover:text-sky-600 transition-colors">
              TPA Naneymi (Daycare)
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6 font-sans">
              Penitipan anak harian yang aman, higienis, dan terpercaya bagi orang tua yang bekerja. Didampingi pengasuh terlatih dengan stimulasi motorik dini dan jadwal istirahat tertata.
            </p>
          </div>
          <ul class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 space-y-3 pt-5 border-t border-sky-100 font-sans">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-sky-100 text-sky-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 border border-sky-200">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xs font-bold">check</span>
              </span>
              <span class="font-medium">Makanan Sehat Bergizi</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-sky-100 text-sky-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 border border-sky-200">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xs font-bold">check</span>
              </span>
              <span class="font-medium">Laporan Harian Anak</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- KB (Playgroup) - Cheerful Amber Yellow Theme -->
        <div 
          class="relative bg-white rounded-[2.5rem] p-7 sm:p-8 border-3 border-amber-200 shadow-soft hover:shadow-xl flex flex-col justify-between transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 group"
          data-aos="fade-up"
          data-aos-delay="200"
        >
          <!-- Cute Icon Badge Top Right -->
          <div class="absolute -top-4 -right-2 w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-amber-100 border-2 border-amber-300 text-amber-700 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl shadow-sm -rotate-6 group-hover:-rotate-12 transition-transform">
            🎨
          </div>

          <div>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-bold text-xs border border-amber-200 font-sans">
              <span>🤹</span> Usia 2 - 4 Tahun
            </span>
            <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-4 mb-2.5 font-sans group-hover:text-amber-600 transition-colors">
              KB Naneymi (Playgroup)
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6 font-sans">
              Kelompok bermain aktif dengan metode *learning through play*. Melatih kemandirian, sosialisasi teman sebaya, pengenalan hijaiyah ceria, dan doa-doa pendek.
            </p>
          </div>
          <ul class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 space-y-3 pt-5 border-t border-amber-100 font-sans">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-amber-100 text-amber-700 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 border border-amber-200">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xs font-bold">check</span>
              </span>
              <span class="font-medium">Stimulasi Sensori &amp; Bahasa</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-amber-100 text-amber-700 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 border border-amber-200">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xs font-bold">check</span>
              </span>
              <span class="font-medium">Pengenalan Huruf &amp; Angka Ceria</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- TK (Kindergarten) - Sweet Lavender & Emerald Theme -->
        <div 
          class="relative bg-white rounded-[2.5rem] p-7 sm:p-8 border-3 border-emerald-200 shadow-soft hover:shadow-xl flex flex-col justify-between transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 group"
          data-aos="fade-up"
          data-aos-delay="300"
        >
          <!-- Cute Icon Badge Top Right -->
          <div class="absolute -top-4 -right-2 w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-100 border-2 border-emerald-300 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl shadow-sm rotate-6 group-hover:rotate-12 transition-transform">
            🎒
          </div>

          <div>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 font-bold text-xs border border-emerald-200 font-sans">
              <span>⭐</span> Usia 4 - 6 Tahun
            </span>
            <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-4 mb-2.5 font-sans group-hover:text-emerald-700 transition-colors">
              TK Naneymi (Kindergarten)
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6 font-sans">
              Kesiapan transisi masuk sekolah dasar dengan pondasi membaca, menulis, berhitung yang menyenangkan, hafalan Juz 30 pilihan, dan praktik sholat dhuha teratur.
            </p>
          </div>
          <ul class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 space-y-3 pt-5 border-t border-emerald-100 font-sans">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 border border-emerald-200">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xs font-bold">check</span>
              </span>
              <span class="font-medium">Praktek Sholat &amp; Wudhu</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 border border-emerald-200">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xs font-bold">check</span>
              </span>
              <span class="font-medium">Calistung Menyenangkan</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
